      // ══ GCSE Computer Science boards (level: gcse) — inserted by the GCSE Computer Science build ══
      // ── AQA GCSE Computer Science 8525 (level: gcse) — QP/MS links from AQA's 8525 assessment-resources page, every one checked to return a PDF on 2026-10-21.
