                  'Control unit: Decodes instructions // determines the type of an instruction',
                  'Control unit: Manages the execution of instructions (A. executes instructions)',
                  'Control unit: Controls/sequences/manages/synchronises the operation of the computer/processor // the fetch-execute cycle (A. F-E cycle, FDE cycle as BOD; NE. just F-E, FDE)',
                  'Control unit: Sends control signals to other components',
                  'Control unit: Stores the state of the processor / the volatile environment when an interrupt occurs (A. deals with interrupts)',
