              '9(c)(i)': { type: 'exact', points: ['D — there is no difference in allele richness between the two populations'], guidance: '1 mark.' },
              '9(c)(ii)': { type: 'points', points: ['Correct completion of table: gene 9 = 5 / 25 / 2.78; gene 10 = 1 / 1 / 0.25 (1)', 'Correct substitution into the equation (1)', 'Correct calculation of chi-squared value: 16.50 / 16.5 (1)'], guidance: '3 marks. Correct answer with no working gains full marks. ALLOW ecf for 2 marks. Accept 16.49 if 2.77 used, 16.52 if 2.8 used, 16.42 if 2.7 used in the table.' },
