              '01.5': { type: 'points', points: ['M1 As T increases rate (1/t) increases OR time for completion decreases', 'M2 Exponentially OR By a greater/increasing factor', 'M3 Many more particles have E ≥ Ea'], guidance: '3 marks (AO1 ×2; AO2 ×1). Or rate increases more and more as temp increases i.e. description of exponential increase NOT just higher collision frequency NOT just more successful collisions' },
