              '04.2': { type: 'points', points: ['M1 correct peptide link (Allow -CONH- as a minimum)', 'M2 correct amino acid R groups: –NH–CH(CH₂OH)–CO–NH–CH(CH₂SH)–CO– OR –NH–CH(CH₂SH)–CO–NH–CH(CH₂OH)–CO– [drawn]'], guidance: '2 marks (AO2 ×2). M1 for correct peptide link (Allow -CONH- as a minimum) M2 for the correct amino acid R groups Dipeptide can only score M1 Trailing bonds not needed' },
