              '1(b)': { type: 'points', points: ['The only correct answer is B (generation of biodegradable materials) A is not correct because some poly(alkenes) may be used as a feedstock for cracking C is not correct because some poly(alkenes) may be used for energy from incineration D is not correct because some poly(alkenes) may be used for recycling to make new materials'], guidance: '1 mark.' },
