              '32(a)': { type: 'points', points: ['C₈H₁₈ + 8½O₂ → 8CO + 9H₂O'], guidance: '1 mark (AO1.2). IGNORE state symbols ALLOW 2, 17, 16, 18 as an alternative for balancing' },
              '32(b)': { type: 'points', points: ['Skeletal formula of 2,2,3-trimethylpentane [drawn in the mark scheme]'], guidance: '1 mark (AO1.1).' },
              '32(c)(i)': { type: 'points', points: ['(q = mcΔT) q = 250 x 4.18 x 35.5 = 37097.5 J', 'n = 2.73 / 46 = 5.93478 x 10⁻² mol', 'ΔcH = -(37097.5 / 5.93478 x 10⁻²) / 1000 = - 625 (kJ mol⁻¹)'], guidance: '3 marks (AO2.4 (x3)). Answer line: If answer = -625 (kJ mol⁻¹) award 3 marks. ALLOW 2 or more sf ALLOW ECF (+)625 (kJmol⁻¹) scores 2' },
              '32(c)(ii)': { type: 'points', points: ['Error 1: heat transferred/’lost’ (to surroundings)', 'Correction 1: use a draft shield/lagging/lid', 'Error 2: evaporation (of ethanol) from spirit burner', 'Correction 2: put a cap/lid on burner (when not burning)/ weigh burner immediately it is blown out'], guidance: '4 marks (AO3.4 (x4)). Any two errors identified with appropriate correction. Also in the mark scheme: Error 3: uneven distribution of heat / not recorded highest temperature reached Correction 3: stir water. Use of polystyrene cup CON correction 1 ALLOW Error: evaporation of (hot) water from can Correction: cover (can) with a lid Ignore incomplete combustion' },
