              '1(b)': {"type":"points","points":["Knowledge - Correctly labelled original demand and supply (1)","annotated to show the demand curve shifted to the right (1)","Application As a result of demand shifting right: – Price increase (1)","Output increase (1)","Original and new equilibrium points identified (1+1)"],"guidance":"4 marks: Knowledge 2, Application 2. ALLOW horizontal supply. Award a maximum of three marks if supply also shifts Diagram e.g."},
